WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.840
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.920 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:56.120 --> 01:58.280
Help!

02:13.600 --> 02:14.600
Daqiang,

02:14.680 --> 02:16.280
why are you here?

02:16.360 --> 02:17.480
I was just passing by.

02:18.640 --> 02:19.840
Just passing by?

02:19.920 --> 02:21.320
Didn't I tell you to wait at home?

02:21.400 --> 02:24.080
Who told you to run around?
Don't you know that it's dangerous here?

02:24.160 --> 02:25.440
What if you get caught?

02:27.640 --> 02:29.520
This beast hurt you, right?

02:33.680 --> 02:35.200
What beast?

02:35.280 --> 02:36.800
Do you mean Yingzhao?

02:37.360 --> 02:38.760
Were you the one who subdued it?

02:40.480 --> 02:41.680
Say something.

02:57.160 --> 02:58.560
What are you doing, Daqiang?

03:06.240 --> 03:07.680
Don't hurt him.

03:13.640 --> 03:15.560
Yingzhao, you're hurt.

03:16.400 --> 03:17.600
Let me heal you.

04:08.520 --> 04:10.160
This beast hurt you.

04:10.240 --> 04:12.080
Why won't you let me kill him?

04:14.480 --> 04:15.520
He's already in this state.

04:15.600 --> 04:16.959
How can I bear to kill him?

04:17.519 --> 04:18.519
You can't bear that?

04:19.440 --> 04:21.000
Isn't that human nature?

04:21.560 --> 04:22.960
Human nature?

04:23.560 --> 04:25.320
Because of this nature,

04:25.400 --> 04:28.640
it made you softhearted, hesitant,
and reckless.

04:28.720 --> 04:30.320
I will remove

04:30.400 --> 04:32.000
this nature of yours completely

04:32.080 --> 04:33.440
so you won't be in danger again.

04:33.520 --> 04:34.520
Do you dare to do that?

04:37.360 --> 04:39.800
Yes, I'm being emotional.

04:40.680 --> 04:41.840
But without emotions,

04:41.920 --> 04:43.320
we will be like…

04:45.000 --> 04:46.720
a tree without leaves,

04:46.800 --> 04:47.960
a flower that never blooms,

04:48.520 --> 04:49.920
a bird without wings.

04:50.480 --> 04:52.200
Anyway,

04:52.280 --> 04:53.520
we'll be disabled.

04:59.360 --> 05:00.400
What do you know?

05:00.920 --> 05:03.160
Being heartless can help you
analyze the pros and cons.

05:03.240 --> 05:05.640
Without love, we won't feel pity.

05:06.120 --> 05:07.240
If you didn't pity them,

05:07.800 --> 05:09.120
you wouldn't have cut yourself

05:09.200 --> 05:10.360
to distract Yingzhao.

05:10.440 --> 05:12.440
And you wouldn't
have placed yourself in danger.

05:14.120 --> 05:15.320
Daqiang,

05:15.400 --> 05:16.440
you're wrong.

05:17.000 --> 05:18.840
If what you said is true

05:18.920 --> 05:21.680
and we only cared about our own safety

05:21.760 --> 05:23.440
and were scattered,

05:23.520 --> 05:26.200
we would've been eaten by Yingzhao
a long time ago.

05:27.200 --> 05:29.440
Because we pity each other

05:29.520 --> 05:32.320
and don't want to see any of us die,

05:32.400 --> 05:34.080
we faced our fears

05:34.160 --> 05:35.440
and worked together

05:35.520 --> 05:37.400
to win time for survival.

05:37.960 --> 05:40.200
So emotions aren't a burden.

05:40.280 --> 05:42.480
It's the reason we survived this time.

06:04.240 --> 06:05.680
Are you spacing out?

06:11.040 --> 06:11.920
Daqiang.

06:12.000 --> 06:13.400
I know

06:13.480 --> 06:15.680
that you've been locked up for too long,

06:15.760 --> 06:17.760
so you're more aggressive.

06:18.400 --> 06:20.560
No matter how dark your past was,

06:20.640 --> 06:21.760
you must believe

06:22.440 --> 06:25.000
that there are still
a lot of good people in this world.

06:28.640 --> 06:29.480
Orchid!

06:31.120 --> 06:32.120
It's Lord Changheng.

06:32.200 --> 06:33.240
You need to go.

06:33.320 --> 06:34.160
Orchid!

06:36.240 --> 06:37.240
Why are you still here?

06:37.800 --> 06:38.680
Don't worry.

06:38.760 --> 06:40.080
Lord Changheng is very powerful.

06:40.160 --> 06:41.520
With him around, I won't be in danger.

06:41.600 --> 06:42.680
- Go.
- Orchid!

06:45.920 --> 06:46.800
Go.

06:46.880 --> 06:49.040
- If he sees you here, he'd think I--
- Orchid!

06:49.120 --> 06:50.160
What?

06:51.400 --> 06:53.320
Think you're colluding
and fornicating with a criminal?

06:53.400 --> 06:54.440
You…

06:57.280 --> 06:58.160
Orchid!

07:00.280 --> 07:01.400
I'm here!

07:01.480 --> 07:02.320
Orchid!

07:04.120 --> 07:05.240
- Greetings--
- Are you all right?

07:09.240 --> 07:10.240
I'm fine.

07:19.880 --> 07:20.720
That's good.

07:22.200 --> 07:23.160
Lord Changheng,

07:23.240 --> 07:24.880
how are Fairy Danyin and the others?

07:24.960 --> 07:26.000
They are all fine.

07:28.000 --> 07:28.880
Are you all right?

07:33.360 --> 07:34.240
Are you all right?

07:34.800 --> 07:37.360
How did you escape just now?

07:39.080 --> 07:40.320
My lord,

07:40.880 --> 07:43.520
I don't know why Yingzhao
suddenly went crazy just now.

07:43.600 --> 07:45.120
It kept chasing me.

07:45.720 --> 07:47.640
I was very scared,

07:47.720 --> 07:49.080
so I kept running.

07:49.160 --> 07:50.400
When I reached here,

07:50.480 --> 07:51.640
it suddenly…

07:52.760 --> 07:54.600
It suddenly went back to normal.

07:54.680 --> 07:55.920
This is a serious matter.

07:56.000 --> 07:58.360
You'd better not hide anything.

07:59.200 --> 08:00.160
I…

08:00.240 --> 08:01.800
I've said everything I need to say.

08:01.880 --> 08:03.480
If it's the truth,

08:03.560 --> 08:05.200
why are you being so dodgy?

08:06.640 --> 08:07.480
I…

08:08.160 --> 08:09.000
My lord,

08:09.560 --> 08:11.160
I don't think she wants to hide anything.

08:11.240 --> 08:12.440
She is just in shock.

08:20.120 --> 08:21.320
Is that so?

08:21.880 --> 08:23.280
She only has a few thousand years
of cultivation.

08:23.360 --> 08:25.400
She used herself as bait
to distract Yingzhao.

08:25.480 --> 08:26.680
It's normal for her to be in shock.

08:28.680 --> 08:29.840
My lord,

08:30.400 --> 08:32.320
you look so fierce.

08:32.400 --> 08:34.360
You look just like that crazy Yingzhao.

08:34.440 --> 08:36.440
She's just a weak fairy,

08:36.520 --> 08:37.559
not your prisoner.

08:38.360 --> 08:39.280
Besides,

08:39.360 --> 08:41.480
she just saved your daughter's life.

08:43.280 --> 08:44.400
I was just anxious.

08:44.960 --> 08:46.120
Please forgive me.

08:46.200 --> 08:47.840
Thank you for saving my daughter.

09:03.560 --> 09:06.360
I once read about it
in ancient forbidden books.

09:07.040 --> 09:09.280
It can capture people's souls,
control their minds,

09:09.360 --> 09:10.840
and stimulate their anger to kill.

09:12.160 --> 09:13.440
It must be

09:13.520 --> 09:14.800
caused by the evil qi.

09:15.360 --> 09:16.880
Only the Moon Tribe and immortal criminals

09:16.960 --> 09:19.360
would rear such an evil creature.

09:20.040 --> 09:21.800
Why is it in Shuiyuntian?

09:22.520 --> 09:25.120
- Evil qi?
- Did I miss any immortal criminal escapees

09:25.200 --> 09:26.840
from Haotian Tower a few days ago?

09:41.040 --> 09:42.280
Your name is Orchid?

09:51.840 --> 09:53.400
Greetings, Lord Ronghao.

10:02.040 --> 10:03.560
You must be Arbiter's disciple.

10:04.880 --> 10:07.320
But my master has been traveling
for a long time.

10:07.400 --> 10:09.160
Maybe for almost a thousand years.

10:09.720 --> 10:11.120
Do you miss her a lot?

10:11.200 --> 10:13.200
I miss her every day.

10:15.280 --> 10:16.960
My master has been away
for a long time too.

10:17.920 --> 10:19.200
I miss her too.

10:19.680 --> 10:22.760
When will your master return?

10:24.520 --> 10:25.600
I don't know.

10:25.680 --> 10:26.640
However,

10:27.280 --> 10:28.760
I think she'll be back soon.

10:38.560 --> 10:41.760
Refining evil qi requires
a lot of primordial spirits of the dead.

10:41.840 --> 10:44.480
Also, the Soul Transformation Cauldron
needed for that

10:44.560 --> 10:46.600
was already lost during ancient times.

10:48.280 --> 10:51.440
Evil qi has vanished for hundreds
of thousands of years in the three realms.

10:51.520 --> 10:53.720
Why did it suddenly appear in Shuiyuntian?

10:54.520 --> 10:55.920
Why did it suddenly

10:56.880 --> 10:58.280
possess Yingzhao?

11:00.080 --> 11:01.600
Don't worry, Lord Changheng.

11:01.680 --> 11:04.200
I've ordered men to seal
the Spirit Lock Gate.

11:04.280 --> 11:07.200
No matter who brought the evil qi,

11:07.280 --> 11:08.760
they can't escape from Yujing.

11:10.440 --> 11:11.720
You sealed the Spirit Lock Gate?

11:11.800 --> 11:12.680
What about me?

11:13.440 --> 11:14.760
I'm meeting someone for drinks

11:14.840 --> 11:16.360
at Yunmeng Lake.

11:17.040 --> 11:19.120
You have to prioritize matters.

11:19.200 --> 11:20.560
As for drinking and entertainment,

11:20.640 --> 11:22.680
you should plan them for later,
Lord Ronghao.

11:45.920 --> 11:47.680
Did Master reply to my letter?

12:04.760 --> 12:05.920
Fairy Orchid,

12:06.000 --> 12:08.520
you're the first candidate
to subdue the monster today.

12:08.600 --> 12:09.800
Your performance is excellent.

12:09.880 --> 12:11.840
You ranked first in the exam.

12:11.920 --> 12:12.760
Congratulations.

12:14.080 --> 12:15.480
First place?

12:15.560 --> 12:16.920
I ranked first in the exam.

12:17.000 --> 12:18.280
I can enter Fountain Palace now!

12:21.280 --> 12:23.600
I already captured the immortal criminal
escapees from Haotian Tower

12:23.680 --> 12:24.600
a few days ago.

12:25.520 --> 12:27.120
Could I have missed someone?

12:28.560 --> 12:29.440
What should I do?

12:29.520 --> 12:30.920
I hid Daqiang

12:31.000 --> 12:32.680
and lied to Lord Changheng.

12:32.760 --> 12:33.920
Was today's incident

12:34.000 --> 12:35.840
really Daqiang's doing?

12:38.680 --> 12:42.040
LIUFANG PAVILION, HAISHI

13:04.000 --> 13:06.360
You couldn't even kill a little fairy.

13:06.440 --> 13:09.200
You even left the evil qi at the scene
and it was found.

13:13.280 --> 13:15.520
Do you think

13:15.600 --> 13:17.320
I should have killed you back then?

13:20.040 --> 13:21.920
Please forgive me. I deserve to die.

13:22.000 --> 13:23.160
But…

13:24.200 --> 13:27.280
the mysterious man
who made a fuss in Haishi a few days ago

13:27.800 --> 13:28.880
suddenly appeared.

13:31.360 --> 13:32.440
I…

13:32.520 --> 13:33.800
I couldn't win against him.

13:34.840 --> 13:36.080
So this time,

13:36.840 --> 13:38.480
have you figured out who he is?

13:53.920 --> 13:55.280
Hellfire?

13:58.480 --> 14:01.080
I asked you to keep an eye on her

14:01.160 --> 14:03.280
and you let her place herself in danger.

14:04.160 --> 14:05.440
How should you be punished?

14:07.120 --> 14:08.120
I was negligent.

14:08.680 --> 14:10.200
I almost delayed your plan.

14:10.680 --> 14:11.680
Please punish me.

14:18.280 --> 14:20.120
Fortunately, she is safe.

14:20.200 --> 14:21.400
Remember.

14:21.480 --> 14:23.720
From now on, if I'm not around,

14:23.800 --> 14:25.960
you are not allowed to leave her side.

14:26.760 --> 14:28.560
If she gets hurt,

14:28.640 --> 14:31.080
I will remove all of your dragon scales

14:31.160 --> 14:32.520
and remove your dragon tendons.

14:32.600 --> 14:34.160
Yes.

14:34.240 --> 14:35.520
Rise.

14:41.280 --> 14:43.760
When I saved Orchid from Haishi that day,

14:43.840 --> 14:45.800
I sensed the evil qi.

14:46.440 --> 14:49.080
Today, Yingzhao also went crazy
due to the evil qi.

14:49.760 --> 14:51.760
Evil qi is an ancient residue.

14:51.840 --> 14:53.720
Getting it requires intense cultivation.

14:54.280 --> 14:56.160
This can't be a coincidence.

14:56.240 --> 14:57.240
My lord,

14:58.560 --> 14:59.640
do you mean

15:00.760 --> 15:02.240
Yingzhao went crazy today

15:03.040 --> 15:04.400
because of Haishi?

15:07.280 --> 15:09.960
They tried everything to get to Orchid.

15:10.560 --> 15:12.640
Maybe it's because Orchid knows

15:12.720 --> 15:14.520
the secret of Lady Chidi's Destiny Book.

15:15.160 --> 15:17.440
They want to kill her
during the immortal examination.

15:18.160 --> 15:19.600
How much do you know about Haishi?

15:20.480 --> 15:21.520
My lord, please forgive me.

15:22.280 --> 15:24.480
I know very little about Haishi.

15:25.640 --> 15:28.000
I only know that Haishi was formed
after the Battle of Two Tribes.

15:28.800 --> 15:29.680
And the Lord of Haishi

15:29.760 --> 15:31.400
is highly powerful and unpredictable.

15:32.160 --> 15:33.920
He never shows his real face.

15:35.080 --> 15:36.840
Thirty thousand years ago…

15:37.520 --> 15:38.800
In that case,

15:39.520 --> 15:41.520
Haishi was formed

15:41.600 --> 15:44.080
when Lady Chidi
was experiencing tribulations.

15:44.640 --> 15:47.200
Lady Chidi's Destiny Book
is also hidden in Haishi.

15:47.800 --> 15:48.920
Could it be

15:50.200 --> 15:52.200
that the Lord of Haishi

15:52.280 --> 15:54.880
is the keeper
of the primordial spirit of Lady Chidi?

15:58.000 --> 16:00.080
Dongfang Qiang, come out.
I want to talk to you.

16:11.960 --> 16:13.360
Daqiang, let me ask you.

16:13.440 --> 16:15.600
Why were you in Shuyu Forest today?

16:17.080 --> 16:19.080
I said I was just passing by.

16:19.760 --> 16:21.000
Although my power is weak,

16:21.080 --> 16:22.080
I'm not stupid.

16:22.680 --> 16:23.680
Tell me honestly.

16:23.760 --> 16:25.880
Was that evil qi your doing?

16:26.440 --> 16:27.280
How ridiculous.

16:28.080 --> 16:29.480
If I really wanted to hurt someone,

16:29.960 --> 16:32.120
I don't need these dirty tricks.

16:33.440 --> 16:34.560
Stop quibbling.

16:34.640 --> 16:36.080
Lord Changheng said

16:36.160 --> 16:37.840
the evil qi is ferocious.

16:37.920 --> 16:40.400
No one will use it except
for the Moon Tribe and immortal criminals.

16:42.400 --> 16:43.720
Is what Changheng said

16:44.240 --> 16:45.680
all true?

16:45.760 --> 16:47.200
Today, in Shuyu Forest,

16:47.280 --> 16:49.560
other than the fairies
who participated in the exam,

16:49.640 --> 16:50.600
only Lord Changheng,

16:50.680 --> 16:51.520
Supreme Liyuan,

16:51.600 --> 16:53.360
Lord Ronghao,
and Aunt Sansheng were there.

16:53.440 --> 16:55.080
If you didn't do it,

16:55.160 --> 16:56.440
did they?

16:56.520 --> 16:57.800
I told you it wasn't me.

16:57.880 --> 17:00.120
And you'd better be glad
that it wasn't me.

17:00.200 --> 17:01.600
If I wanted to kill,

17:01.680 --> 17:04.400
no one in Shuyu Forest
would've gotten out alive.

17:06.680 --> 17:08.440
Including your Changheng.

17:08.920 --> 17:09.800
It's my fault.

17:10.280 --> 17:11.200
It's all my fault.

17:11.280 --> 17:12.640
I've been softhearted towards you.

17:12.720 --> 17:14.599
I didn't report you to Lord Changheng.

17:15.240 --> 17:17.800
Today, Danyin and the others
almost died because of Yingzhao.

17:18.280 --> 17:20.560
If anything were to happen to them today,

17:20.640 --> 17:21.960
I am to blame.

17:23.440 --> 17:24.960
I don't care what your motive is.

17:25.040 --> 17:27.119
Come and turn yourself in
to Lord Changheng.

17:27.200 --> 17:28.079
Let's go!

17:35.240 --> 17:36.080
My lord,

17:36.160 --> 17:37.000
are you really

17:37.680 --> 17:38.960
going to turn yourself in?

17:39.520 --> 17:41.080
I don't want to turn myself in too.

17:41.800 --> 17:43.480
But my body…

17:44.040 --> 17:46.640
You must go even if you don't want to.
There's no room for discussion.

17:46.720 --> 17:47.600
My lord,

17:47.680 --> 17:50.560
I know all the people combined
at Shuiyuntian are no match for you.

17:50.640 --> 17:51.680
But now,

17:51.760 --> 17:53.080
we haven't achieved our plan yet.

17:53.160 --> 17:54.480
We should not alert them.

17:54.560 --> 17:56.840
Then you should figure out a way!

17:56.920 --> 17:58.320
There's no other way!

17:58.400 --> 18:00.480
Turning yourself in is the only way.

18:00.560 --> 18:04.080
My lord, only you can explain
and ask her to withdraw her order.

18:04.160 --> 18:05.480
How ridiculous.

18:05.560 --> 18:07.200
I never explain.

18:07.280 --> 18:08.680
What else can you explain?

18:08.760 --> 18:10.840
All the clues are pointing to you.

18:13.200 --> 18:15.400
My lord, if you don't compromise,
you'll ruin the plan.

18:18.160 --> 18:19.160
Little Flower Spirit.

18:20.840 --> 18:21.840
What?

18:21.920 --> 18:23.960
Don't you want to know
why I went to Shuyu Forest?

18:24.040 --> 18:25.120
I will

18:25.200 --> 18:26.360
explain it to you.

18:29.720 --> 18:32.440
- Go ahead.
- I wanted to help you pass the exam.

18:33.160 --> 18:34.800
Help me pass the exam?

18:34.880 --> 18:38.040
Which fairy would like to enter
the Shuyu Forest first?

18:55.240 --> 18:57.200
Help!

19:05.680 --> 19:06.640
Daqiang,

19:06.720 --> 19:08.040
why are you here?

19:08.520 --> 19:09.560
I was just passing by.

19:11.440 --> 19:13.200
So you were the one helping me.

19:13.280 --> 19:14.920
I already told you

19:15.000 --> 19:16.160
that I'd only protect you.

19:16.240 --> 19:17.200
I won't hurt you.

19:17.800 --> 19:19.760
Yingzhao almost killed you today.

19:19.840 --> 19:21.280
If you die,

19:21.360 --> 19:22.680
I'll die too.

19:23.560 --> 19:25.760
So how could I have done it?

19:26.760 --> 19:28.080
Is my life

19:28.160 --> 19:30.280
that important to you?

19:31.560 --> 19:34.280
It's as important as my own life.

19:35.160 --> 19:36.000
Daqiang,

19:36.640 --> 19:37.560
I'm sorry.

19:38.280 --> 19:40.200
I think I misunderstood you.

19:42.800 --> 19:45.160
Then don't turn yourself in.

19:45.240 --> 19:48.320
If they think that you caused this,

19:48.400 --> 19:50.320
they'll definitely take you back
to Haotian Tower.

19:50.400 --> 19:52.520
Then you can never come back.

20:22.240 --> 20:23.680
What now?

20:24.880 --> 20:26.960
Didn't I explain it clearly?

20:27.040 --> 20:28.760
Why are you still upset?

20:30.480 --> 20:33.640
I thought my power really improved.

20:34.400 --> 20:35.600
But in the end,

20:35.680 --> 20:37.840
I rejoiced too soon.

20:42.520 --> 20:45.640
I'll explain to Aunt Sansheng tomorrow

20:45.720 --> 20:48.040
and cancel my result
of winning first place.

20:48.680 --> 20:49.720
Why?

20:51.000 --> 20:52.560
Thank you, Daqiang.

20:53.160 --> 20:55.200
Although my power is weak,

20:55.760 --> 20:57.200
I still have my values.

20:57.280 --> 20:58.800
Cheating is cheating.

21:00.600 --> 21:03.600
But if I tell everyone that you helped me,

21:03.680 --> 21:06.160
will you be taken back
to Haotian Tower again?

21:06.240 --> 21:09.080
Haven't you always wanted me
to go back to Haotian Tower?

21:10.120 --> 21:12.000
I do.

21:15.680 --> 21:18.520
But after going through
so many things together,

21:18.600 --> 21:20.760
I don't seem to want it as much.

21:28.760 --> 21:29.600
Forget it.

21:30.080 --> 21:31.960
You wouldn't understand.

21:32.040 --> 21:33.000
Anyway,

21:33.080 --> 21:35.320
don't be so nice to me anymore.

21:38.120 --> 21:39.280
Why?

21:39.840 --> 21:40.920
It's like

21:41.600 --> 21:43.520
you've always been taking medicine.

21:43.600 --> 21:45.240
Because you're used to it,

21:45.320 --> 21:47.280
you never think it's bitter.

21:48.760 --> 21:50.360
But one day,

21:50.440 --> 21:52.200
someone gave you candy

21:52.280 --> 21:53.920
while you were taking your medicine.

21:54.520 --> 21:56.800
Because you've tasted
the sweetness of the candy,

21:56.880 --> 21:58.440
the same medicine

21:58.520 --> 21:59.680
that you've taken before

21:59.760 --> 22:01.600
will now be too bitter to swallow.

22:09.080 --> 22:10.160
In the past,

22:10.240 --> 22:11.600
when my master was not around,

22:11.680 --> 22:13.600
I've been guarding the Arbiter Hall alone.

22:14.440 --> 22:16.120
I never felt lonely.

22:16.680 --> 22:18.520
Then you suddenly came.

22:18.600 --> 22:20.200
You accompanied me all day

22:20.280 --> 22:22.080
and let me get some sun.

22:22.160 --> 22:23.360
You cooked porridge for me

22:24.560 --> 22:26.040
and helped me with the exam.

22:29.120 --> 22:31.200
I'm afraid I'll get used to it.

22:31.840 --> 22:33.280
After you leave,

22:34.080 --> 22:36.080
I'll be alone again.

22:36.600 --> 22:38.560
I'm like the person
who has tasted the candy.

22:42.680 --> 22:45.000
I don't want to taste bitterness anymore.

23:05.440 --> 23:08.240
What nonsense is this little flower spirit

23:09.160 --> 23:11.160
saying?

23:12.520 --> 23:15.200
Why can't I understand?

24:04.440 --> 24:05.400
How strange.

24:06.920 --> 24:08.840
I can see you every day,

24:10.560 --> 24:13.320
but why does it seem like I can't remember
your face more and more?

24:19.680 --> 24:20.560
Hao.

24:21.200 --> 24:22.560
You're being childish again.

24:23.720 --> 24:25.240
I've already lit the candles for you.

24:27.840 --> 24:28.760
This way,

24:29.440 --> 24:31.680
you won't be afraid
of having nightmares anymore.

24:40.000 --> 24:41.800
You're the God of War of the three realms.

24:42.760 --> 24:43.920
No one can defeat you.

24:45.720 --> 24:47.120
What have I done

24:49.160 --> 24:50.680
to let this hand

24:51.800 --> 24:53.240
that wields the Shuofeng Sword

24:55.000 --> 24:56.240
light candles for me?

25:01.240 --> 25:02.120
I'm useless.

25:02.200 --> 25:04.280
I'm not gentle like the former God of War.

25:04.360 --> 25:05.560
Please spare my life.

25:14.560 --> 25:16.280
How dare you kneel

25:16.920 --> 25:18.160
with her face on?

25:19.920 --> 25:21.880
She won't make that look on your face.

25:22.560 --> 25:23.760
Stop crying.

26:33.920 --> 26:35.680
People suffer from seven emotions.

26:36.600 --> 26:38.600
Joy, worry,

26:38.680 --> 26:41.640
sadness, pity, love,

26:41.720 --> 26:43.120
hate, jealousy.

26:43.600 --> 26:46.320
These will be the stumbling blocks
when you make decisions.

26:47.240 --> 26:48.200
Cut off emotions.

26:48.280 --> 26:49.480
Don't love.

26:50.040 --> 26:51.240
Without weakness,

26:51.800 --> 26:54.160
you won't be softhearted.

26:54.240 --> 26:57.040
Then you'll become the strongest
in the three realms.

27:07.960 --> 27:10.480
Because we pity each other

27:10.560 --> 27:13.080
and don't want to see any of us die,

27:13.160 --> 27:14.800
we faced our fears

27:14.880 --> 27:16.360
and worked together

27:16.440 --> 27:18.440
to win time for survival.

27:18.520 --> 27:21.000
So emotions aren't a burden.

27:21.080 --> 27:23.240
It's the reason we survived this time.

27:41.760 --> 27:43.920
Didn't you want to pass the exam?

27:44.000 --> 27:45.800
Why do you want to cancel the result now?

27:45.880 --> 27:47.240
Wouldn't everything be in vain then?

27:48.600 --> 27:50.120
I'm weak.

27:50.200 --> 27:51.800
But I never cheat.

27:52.360 --> 27:53.680
I won't accept

27:53.760 --> 27:54.920
a result that isn't mine.

28:02.120 --> 28:03.080
A firefly?

28:03.160 --> 28:04.800
You've already scared the fireflies away.

28:05.320 --> 28:06.560
The Magical Firefly Stone

28:06.640 --> 28:08.760
is just an ordinary stone.

28:09.840 --> 28:11.160
Here you are.

28:19.800 --> 28:21.600
Have you been eating my flowers?

28:27.560 --> 28:29.400
Why do you keep eating the same one?

28:29.480 --> 28:31.040
Why don't you change to another plant?

28:31.120 --> 28:32.560
Try this.

28:32.640 --> 28:34.440
It tastes better and sweeter.

29:04.000 --> 29:05.200
I found the firefly.

29:05.280 --> 29:07.440
I can return them together
to Lord Changheng.

29:08.120 --> 29:09.320
Everything will return
to its original place.

29:09.800 --> 29:11.480
I can also rest assured.

29:41.280 --> 29:42.720
It's him indeed.

29:43.480 --> 29:46.120
Didn't Dongfang Qingcang die
30,000 years ago?

29:46.200 --> 29:48.000
Shuiyuntian just said that

29:48.080 --> 29:50.120
to stabilize the three realms.

29:50.200 --> 29:52.000
Dongfang Qingcang's body
can't be destroyed.

29:52.080 --> 29:53.320
His primordial spirit doesn't reincarnate.

29:53.400 --> 29:54.920
He is the real immortal.

29:55.600 --> 29:56.800
Back then,

29:56.880 --> 29:58.040
Lord Yunzhong

29:58.120 --> 29:59.680
gathered the power of the immortals

29:59.760 --> 30:01.600
to just scatter his primordial spirit

30:02.560 --> 30:04.280
and seal him in this Haotian Tower.

30:10.800 --> 30:12.400
Could it be that day

30:13.160 --> 30:15.080
when we reinforced the Haotian Matrix

30:17.040 --> 30:19.120
and a little fairy
was sucked into the tower?

30:20.440 --> 30:22.880
Could it be that the little fairy
broke the seal

30:23.640 --> 30:25.760
and gathered
Dongfang Qingcang's primordial spirit?

30:27.200 --> 30:28.360
In the three realms,

30:28.880 --> 30:30.280
besides the Goddess of Xishan,

30:30.960 --> 30:32.880
who else can restore souls?

30:37.800 --> 30:39.160
Yesterday, in Shuyu Forest,

30:39.800 --> 30:41.000
how did that little fairy

30:41.080 --> 30:42.560
subdue Yingzhao?

30:42.640 --> 30:43.840
Tell me in detail.

30:44.800 --> 30:45.960
Don't miss out on anything.

30:47.000 --> 30:48.000
Yes.

30:57.560 --> 30:58.760
Aunt Sansheng,

30:58.840 --> 31:02.640
someone actually helped me
with my immortal examination this time…

31:04.080 --> 31:04.920
No.

31:05.000 --> 31:06.680
I can't say it's Daqiang.

31:09.920 --> 31:11.080
A coincidence.

31:11.160 --> 31:13.440
I'll say my result this time

31:13.520 --> 31:14.760
is just a coincidence.

31:17.000 --> 31:17.840
Stop.

31:20.800 --> 31:21.640
What's the matter?

31:22.280 --> 31:24.040
Are you a big deal now
after ranking first?

31:24.840 --> 31:25.760
No.

31:25.840 --> 31:26.880
Fairy Danyin,

31:26.960 --> 31:29.400
I'm going to see Aunt Sansheng

31:29.480 --> 31:31.000
to cancel my exam result.

31:31.080 --> 31:32.120
What?

31:32.200 --> 31:33.520
Don't be angry.

31:33.600 --> 31:34.960
I know I don't deserve it.

31:35.040 --> 31:36.240
You don't deserve it?

31:37.480 --> 31:39.040
Is the person who saved me

31:39.120 --> 31:41.640
undeserving of the first place?

31:41.720 --> 31:43.480
If you mention canceling the result again,

31:43.560 --> 31:44.960
I'll turn you back
into your original form.

31:46.200 --> 31:47.160
Orchid,

31:47.240 --> 31:48.320
thank you.

31:48.400 --> 31:50.200
Yes, if it weren't for you,

31:50.280 --> 31:51.680
we would have been dead yesterday.

31:51.760 --> 31:54.120
She just got lucky.

31:59.240 --> 32:00.120
Forget it.

32:00.200 --> 32:01.640
You're quite capable.

32:02.280 --> 32:05.400
Much better
than some illiterate young lady.

32:05.480 --> 32:06.720
- You…
- What?

32:06.800 --> 32:09.080
From now on,
I'm a member of the Fountain Palace.

32:09.160 --> 32:10.200
Fairy Danyin,

32:10.280 --> 32:12.480
no matter how noble you are,

32:12.560 --> 32:13.920
if you do anything to me,

32:14.000 --> 32:15.080
what will Lord Changheng

32:15.160 --> 32:16.560
think of you?

32:24.920 --> 32:26.400
She's such a bully.

32:34.120 --> 32:36.040
Thank you, Fairy Danyin.

32:36.640 --> 32:37.920
For what?

32:38.480 --> 32:40.480
I distinguish
between favor and hatred clearly.

32:40.560 --> 32:42.320
Since you saved my life,

32:42.400 --> 32:43.800
I won't bother you anymore.

32:48.960 --> 32:49.840
But remember,

32:49.920 --> 32:51.160
I still hate you.

32:52.280 --> 32:53.320
Why?

32:55.120 --> 32:55.960
No reason.

33:07.480 --> 33:08.480
Lord Changheng.

33:09.440 --> 33:10.960
You won first place brilliantly.

33:11.040 --> 33:12.880
Instead of celebrating, why are you here?

33:14.920 --> 33:16.000
Actually,

33:16.480 --> 33:17.760
I want to ask Aunt Sansheng

33:17.840 --> 33:19.360
to cancel my exam result.

33:19.440 --> 33:20.360
Why?

33:20.440 --> 33:21.680
My power is weak.

33:22.240 --> 33:23.720
I got this honor

33:23.800 --> 33:25.920
merely because I was lucky.

33:26.000 --> 33:26.920
Orchid.

33:28.040 --> 33:29.160
After the Yingzhao incident,

33:29.880 --> 33:30.880
your bravery, wisdom,

33:30.960 --> 33:32.320
kindness, and goodwill

33:32.400 --> 33:33.920
were seen by everyone.

33:34.000 --> 33:36.680
So you deserve the honor
of winning first place.

33:38.240 --> 33:39.160
Besides,

33:39.240 --> 33:40.280
I'm a judge.

33:40.960 --> 33:43.120
I decide your result.

33:43.200 --> 33:44.360
Thank you, Lord Changheng.

33:44.440 --> 33:45.760
I will continue to work hard.

33:48.120 --> 33:48.960
Wait.

33:49.960 --> 33:51.600
Lord Changheng.

33:51.680 --> 33:53.920
I already found your Firefly Stone.

33:54.000 --> 33:55.120
I'll return it to you.

34:09.400 --> 34:10.360
Well…

34:15.080 --> 34:16.360
Hold it again.

34:16.920 --> 34:17.880
No.

34:17.960 --> 34:19.159
I'm clumsy.

34:19.239 --> 34:20.920
What if I break your--

34:27.840 --> 34:29.280
What's going on?

34:30.840 --> 34:33.280
Did you feed it?

34:35.000 --> 34:37.679
I used plants
to lure it into the Firefly Stone.

34:39.520 --> 34:40.360
I see.

34:41.159 --> 34:42.840
You are the first person who fed it.

34:42.920 --> 34:44.560
It acknowledges you as its master.

34:45.400 --> 34:46.440
Master?

34:49.840 --> 34:51.920
What stupid method did I use?

34:52.480 --> 34:53.600
Lord Changheng.

34:53.679 --> 34:54.600
How about this?

34:54.679 --> 34:56.480
You can feed it some precious plants.

34:56.560 --> 34:59.160
Maybe it will look down on my weeds.

34:59.240 --> 35:00.880
Since the firefly sees you as its master,

35:00.960 --> 35:02.720
then this Firefly Stone is yours.

35:02.800 --> 35:04.000
No, I can't.

35:04.080 --> 35:06.280
How can I take your stone?

35:06.360 --> 35:07.760
Fireflies have spirits.

35:07.840 --> 35:09.280
I dare not force it to stay with me.

35:09.360 --> 35:10.960
As Arbiter's disciple,

35:11.040 --> 35:13.560
you should know that we can't force fate.

35:13.640 --> 35:14.800
So

35:14.880 --> 35:16.280
you're following the will of heaven,

35:16.800 --> 35:18.120
not stealing what others love.

36:28.640 --> 36:30.720
Aren't you Fairy Orchid,
who won first place

36:30.800 --> 36:32.000
in the immortal examination?

36:34.240 --> 36:36.120
Greetings, Lord Ronghao.

36:36.680 --> 36:38.680
I don't need too much courtesy.

36:38.760 --> 36:40.280
We'll have many chances to meet

36:40.360 --> 36:41.720
once you enter Fountain Palace.

36:43.600 --> 36:44.520
By the way,

36:45.240 --> 36:47.360
I have a problem now.

36:47.440 --> 36:48.480
I wonder

36:48.560 --> 36:50.360
if you'd be willing to help me.

36:51.560 --> 36:52.840
My power is weak.

36:52.920 --> 36:55.160
If you think it's troublesome,

36:55.240 --> 36:56.920
how can I be of help to you?

36:57.000 --> 36:58.880
You can definitely help me.

37:03.840 --> 37:04.920
Is this

37:05.000 --> 37:06.120
Ice Jade?

37:07.680 --> 37:09.840
Ice Jade has strong vitality.

37:10.360 --> 37:12.160
With enough spiritual energy,

37:12.240 --> 37:13.520
it'll grow with the wind.

37:13.600 --> 37:15.120
Why would it wither?

37:15.680 --> 37:18.600
I heard that plant spirits

37:18.680 --> 37:19.800
have healing abilities.

37:20.280 --> 37:22.000
Please have a look. Can it be saved?

37:29.240 --> 37:31.040
The root is damaged.

37:31.520 --> 37:33.280
Its spiritual energy is drained.

37:33.880 --> 37:35.040
I'm afraid…

37:36.680 --> 37:37.640
I'll try.

37:56.160 --> 37:57.200
It's alive.

37:58.640 --> 37:59.880
I knew I came to the right person.

38:00.760 --> 38:02.160
You flatter me, my lord.

38:02.240 --> 38:04.120
I have to go back to Arbiter Hall to work.

38:04.200 --> 38:05.240
I'll get going then.

38:13.360 --> 38:14.760
My lord, what is this?

38:16.080 --> 38:17.360
In this world,

38:18.280 --> 38:20.120
only one person

38:20.200 --> 38:21.960
can purify evil qi.

38:28.000 --> 38:29.440
She purified evil qi

38:31.240 --> 38:32.880
and brought it back to life.

38:35.680 --> 38:36.800
You are indeed…

38:41.560 --> 38:43.440
the Goddess of Xishan.

39:17.200 --> 39:18.040
Master.

39:19.400 --> 39:21.160
Since you died in battle,

39:21.760 --> 39:23.200
there's nothing left for me to desire

39:24.760 --> 39:26.560
in the three realms.

39:28.120 --> 39:29.680
I suffer every day.

39:31.280 --> 39:33.240
I'm only left with endless pain.

39:36.120 --> 39:38.120
But what I suffered

39:40.160 --> 39:42.400
is nothing compared to yours.

39:45.880 --> 39:47.360
In the past 30,000 years,

39:48.000 --> 39:49.240
do you

39:51.480 --> 39:53.760
blame me for my incompetence too?

40:03.560 --> 40:04.840
Master, don't be afraid.

40:11.000 --> 40:12.920
Even if I have to turn the world
upside down,

40:14.720 --> 40:16.840
even if it means killing everything
in the three realms,

40:18.280 --> 40:20.440
I will find a way

40:21.600 --> 40:22.880
to save you.

40:34.520 --> 40:35.360
Master.

40:37.080 --> 40:38.120
You know what?

40:40.240 --> 40:42.240
We'll meet very soon.
